      "updated": 1790943899204,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "<Your description> I like it. Let's think a little more how our metric (embedding neighbours have close actions) can be useful. \nAlso let's add I think we are doing important anaylysis of what fine tuning does to the VLA, because we compare metrics before and after fine tuning.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "<Your description> I like it. Let's think a little more how our metric (embedding neighbours have close actions) can be useful. \nAlso let's add I think we are doing important anaylysis of what fine tuning does to the VLA, because we compare metrics before and after fine tuning.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
