      "updated": 1790947333880,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "<Here we show how VLM backbones work as embedders. \nHow they degrade after finetuning, how much value action expert adds \nbefore and after fine tuning. How well the performance correlates with our LAC\nmetrics.>",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "<Here we show how VLM backbones work as embedders. \nHow they degrade after finetuning, how much value action expert adds \nbefore and after fine tuning. How well the performance correlates with our LAC\nmetrics.>",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
